            <i data-lucide="cloud-upload" class="w-7 h-7 text-slate-400 group-hover:text-[#FF462D] transition-colors mb-1.5"></i>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700">Click or drag to upload car image</p>
            <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-0.5">JPG, PNG, WEBP — Max 5MB</p>
